-- Experiment 203 -- SIAM 100-Digit Challenge, holdout A for Problem 8 (FriCAS column).
-- Every case is a root of a transcendental function of t; FriCAS has no
-- numeric root finder for a non-polynomial function (as in experiment 173):
-- all rows SKIP.  See heat_crossing.m.
